    "title": "Today's daily horoscope for November 13, 2025: Stay ahead of the curve - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eugenia Last ,\n2 hours ago A look at today’s free daily horoscope readings for Thursday, November 13, 2025. Happy Birthday: Your demeanor is on the rise; confidence is building, and you can sort through your emotional dilemmas this year, making all sorts of impressive headway, if you take your time and let things unfold naturally. Consider what you enjoy doing, what’s necessary and how to balance your days with thought and originality. Think outside the box, and stay ahead of the curve with what’s new and exciting. Your numbers are 9, 14, 21, 25, 34, 41, 48. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
